# Pillow team standards

- Target Python 3.10+ and add type hints to new public functions.
- Never change a public API without a deprecation path.
- Every behaviour change needs a pytest test in `Tests/`, written first.
- Keep pull requests small and focused.
- Do not modify C code in `src/libImaging` unless asked.
- Explain trade-offs in the pull request description.
